#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Greatly expanded the German translation, thanks to Einheit-101."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Added scrolling with the mouse wheel, touchpad, up/down, home/end, and pg up/"
"down keys to the tutorial selection list."
msgstr "Scrollen mit dem Mausrad, Pfeiltasten oder Bild auf/ Bild ab."

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed builders sometimes going to their buildings' rally points instead of "
"to the building where they were requested by the request builder button.  "
"The workaround for this means that builders will always ignore rally points, "
"for the time being."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed a crash on hovering over the caravan list of the Trade Report when you "
"have no caravans."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed replay desyncs caused by setting Caravan and trade ship stop pickup "
"types, deleting trade stops, copying trade routes, or automatic caravan "
"replacement."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Fixed and improved the German translation, thanks to Einheit-101."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed non-English tutorial descriptions getting cut off at the bottom, by "
"adding a scroll bar and buttons, so that all the text can be scrolled and "
"read."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed the config.txt settings not taking effect when there was only a 7kaa "
"config.txt and not an Ambition one."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Added button help text to the Egyptian, Mughal, and Zulu Greater Being spell "
"buttons."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed the Encyclopaedia slideshow showing a blank image until the mouse was "
"moved."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Fixed the grammar in the \"Desperate Bowmen\" scenario description."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed the manual showing the wrong targeting type for the Mughal Greater "
"Being (Djinni)."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Changed the default setting for Help from Full to Brief, to avoid "
"overwhelming new players with information panels.  This only applies to new "
"installations."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Automatically select the Greater Being upon invoking it at a Seat of Power."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Music now plays on the encyclopaedia."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "More changes to make development easier."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "v3.2.7 -- 2025-10-24"
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Automatically detect the language on Windows."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Added a Dutch translation, thanks to Jan Miedema."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Show the average target resistance of independent towns on the information "
"panel when you have workers."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed target resistance being shown incorrectly when you have workers in the "
"independent town."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed the buttons of the Harbour interface overlapping with the production "
"progress bar."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed the Harbour production count not being placed properly on the button."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed mines built outside of natural resources showing \"null\" on their "
"information panels."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed not being able to play replays (R key) because the NONAME.RPL file was "
"being saved to the wrong place."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Base the display of the building guide on the Help setting.  Not shown when "
"set to None; only the grid lines when set to Brief; and both highlighting "
"and grid lines when set to Detailed."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Changed the Harbour ship count to include the currently-building ship, as it "
"blocks other ships from entering, so counts towards the limit."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Pause replays at the end instead of immediately exiting to the menu without "
"warning."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "v3.2.6 -- 2025-10-08"
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"The behaviour of the newly added information panels and the building hitbars "
"(see the sections below) is controlled (for now*) by the Help level setting "
"in the Options menu.  You are encouraged to tweak this setting to your "
"liking."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "When set to None, they will never be displayed."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"When set to Brief, they will be displayed for the currently selected "
"building and any building that is hovered over with the mouse."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"When set to Detailed, they will be displayed for all buildings all the time."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"* Ambition will have its own Settings menu with more fine-grained control "
"over features in the future."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Show an information panel for Towns, with the number of peasants, total "
"population, number of races, and loyalty or resistance."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Show an information panel for Forts, with the general or king leadership "
"level, number of soldiers, and the approximate total strength, including the "
"effects of the leader."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Show information panels for other buildings, with information relevant to "
"them, such as worker and good counts."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Show an information panel for Fryhtan Lairs with their species name and "
"level.  The level is an approximate relative reflection of the species' "
"strength and the gold reward for killing Ordos.  Note that this reflects "
"only the species, not the current unit count and combat level, which can "
"only be seen with a Phoenix."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid "Added a progress bar for Seats of Power."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Greater Beings will now go to the rally points of their Seats of Power when "
"they are summoned."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed a crash that sometimes happened after an earthquake, where automatic "
"caravan cloning would try to both clone and retire an idle caravan at the "
"same time, resulting in a segfault."
msgstr ""

#: src/ambition/version_details.cc
msgid ""
"Fixed the build Fort keybind (F) not working because it was conflicting with "
"selecting a Fort.  The default keybind for selecting a fort has been changed "
"to `N`.  You can change by binding the `KEYEVENT_ _BUILD_ _CAMP` and "
"`KEYEVENT_ _GOTO_ _CAMP` events to different keys in the config.txt file."
